{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1520821-doubts-about-some-effects","id":1520821,"title":"Doubts about some effects","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-17T08:53:50-07:00","id":1520821,"title":"Doubts about some effects","content":"Hello!<br /> <br /> I have some doubts about some effects.<br /> <br /> 1. If I want to turn a glass of blood into poison (give poisonous properties to that blood), is that Matter 2 or 3? Or should I include Life too?<br /> <br /> 2. If I want to fix an intimidation effect for spirits on someone (transmitting the spirits the idea that they shouldnt mess with whoever Im fixing the effect on), is that Spirit 3? Should I add Mind? Should I use Life to fix the effect on the person I want to fix it on?\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-17T11:01:33-07:00","id":1520825,"title":"","content":"1 - Matter 2 should be plenty unless you have a fairly scientific minded mage that's trying something fancier than just making blood poisonous. You shouldn't need Life for blood that's not in a body anymore, though it would be within the bounds of the descriptions of the Spheres for Life to come into play if you're making blood that is still viable for transfusions into something poisonous as well. When tissue is extracted from a living being and becomes a Matter Pattern instead is fairly nebulous, though all the cells in it being dead is generally on the &quot;definitely just Matter&quot; side of things.<br /> <br /> 2 - The base effect would be a Spirit 2/Mind 2 one, since Spirit alone can't create emotional states in spirits, and Mind 2 is how you transmit emotional feelings instead of more specific thoughts. You might need higher Spirit if you want the effect to impact spirits that aren't actively looking at the target on the other side of the Gauntlet, or higher Mind if you want a more specific mental message. You would, most likely, want to lock on the effect with Life since I doubt you only want it to apply while the subject is in one place and until they leave (but there are cases where that might be all you want).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}